## Planned

### [1.1.0]

Ordered so each item unlocks the next.

1. Departure date and nights — unblocks real occupancy and
   everything financial
2. Audit trail — built early so later features are logged from
   the start
3. Rate tab — priced per occupancy per category, internal only,
   never printed
4. ADR, RevPAR and revenue reports
5. Attachment storage
6. Drag-and-drop attachments per group — email, PDF and Word
   for payment confirmations
7. CSV and Excel import with column mapping and a review step

### [2.0.0]

- Desktop packaging with a real database and signed installer
- Automatic updates with rollback
- Merge with Hotel Key Inventory Management into one suite
  sharing property, rooms, users and audit log

